    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Number of people reached through Information, Education and Communication on DRR
2. % of population benefitted through Hazard and risk assessment mapping and impact modelling
3. % increase of population and authorities with enhanced understanding of earthquake and urban risks

